NAME: mice in RED
DESCRIPTION: copy by index with the counter before the code, (start start) as the entry; phase-2 archetype suite (i-7d2612-34b61d), see behtests/archetype_mice.beh
SRC:
(program
  (start entry)
  (let (count 0)
    (let (target 1500)
      (seq
        (DAT 0 (store count))
        (label entry)
        (MOV 7 count)
        (do-while (DN count) (MOV I (Ind count) (Dec target)))
        (SPL (Ind target))
        (ADD 2903 target)
        (JMZ entry count)
        (DAT 0 (store target))))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b
ORG entry

_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #0     
entry 
  MOV.AB #7     , $_LET1 
_DWH11
  MOV.I  @_LET1 , <_LET2 
  DJN.B  $_DWH11, $_LET1 
  SPL    @_LET2 , #0     
  ADD.AB #2903  , $_LET2 
  JMZ.B  $entry , $_LET1 
_LET2 
  DAT    #0     , #1500  
  DAT    $0     , $0     